 *
 * PURPOSE:
 * Blocks PRD.md from being set to `phase: complete` unless a LEARN.md file
 * exists in the same PRD directory. This guarantees that Algorithm LEARN phase
 * reflections are persisted to disk before the session is marked complete.
 *
 * TRIGGER: PreToolUse (matcher: Edit, Write)
